6%9E%AA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/12/dkoe6f95yp9aqs0qqob57x7d7g80023.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E5%9C%A3%E6%9E%AA%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/12/dkoe6f95yp9aqs0qqob57x7d7g80023.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />圣枪·裁决\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">1级效果</span>]，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">圣枪·朗基努斯</span>]技能倍率提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">100%</font>，对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无伤</font></span></span>]状态的敌人，暴击率和暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">扬旗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"旗帜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">旗帜</font></span></span>]光环的范围内的〈骑士同盟〉友军额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害1</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">2级效果</span>]，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">圣枪·朗基努斯</span>]技能倍率提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">115%</font>，对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无伤</font></span></span>]状态的敌人，暴击率和暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">35%</font>，释放后自身获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">扬旗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"旗帜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">旗帜</font></span></span>]光环的范围内的〈骑士同盟〉友军额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害1\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害1</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>（被动）[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">3级效果</span>]，技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">圣枪·朗基努斯</span>]技能倍率提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">130%</font>，对[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"无伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">无伤</font></span></span>]状态的敌人，暴击率和暴击伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>，释放后自身获得<font color=\"#58cb48\">30%</font>生命值的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">物理护盾</font></span></span>]；[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"扬旗\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">扬旗</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"旗帜\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">旗帜</font></span></span>]光环的范围内的〈骑士同盟〉友军额外获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲伤害2</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"谋定之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d3/qmlb51j8oqqntmrlrml3rfbo9gvun25.png/40px-%E8%B0%8B%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https:/